OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOnce the
OL,6,Frain moves away, there will be a dry
OL,7,Fand clear interlude before showers
OL,8,Fmove in, some may be heavy, especially
OL,9,Facross northern parts. Remaining windy
OL,10,Fwith gales possible.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FHeavy and blustery showers
OL,13,Fcontinue, with strong winds reaching
OL,14,Fgale force in places. Showers become
OL,15,Fsparser by the afternoon, but winds
OL,16,Fremain strong.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
