OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FStaying unsettled over the coming
OL,7,Fdays, with bands of rain followed by
OL,8,Fshowers and windy conditions at times.
OL,9,FSettling down later Wednesday as the
OL,10,Fwind eases and showers clear.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
